    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Start and settings\nRuns every day at 7:00, or by hand with **Execute workflow**.\n\nOpen **Settings**: sheet URL and tab, re-check window (days), lookups per run (1 lookup = 1 credit), pause between lookups, and where the summary goes.",
        "height": 660,
