      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Read the sheet and pick rows\n**Read leads** needs your Google Sheets credential (the sheet comes from Settings).\n\nRows without a `website`, rows enriched within the re-check window and repeated websites are skipped, then the list is capped so one run cannot spend more credits than you allow.",
        "height": 660,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "3f56ee26-1fec-44ca-ae05-e0fbe13f0d13",
