    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Look up each website\n**Look up website facts** calls `GET weio.ai/api/site-info` with your Header Auth credential **Weio API key** (`Authorization: Bearer wk_...`). Network errors retry 3 times.\n\n**Normalize result** turns the answer into sheet columns and a status.",
